Tone and code help

i) Cycle through the available types: CTCSS, DCS normal and DCS inverted.
Enter a CTCSS tone in Hz, for example 88.5, or a three-digit DCS code, for example 023. Press Enter.

If YAC asks TX/Both:
t) Apply to transmit only.
b) Apply to transmit and receive.

q) Cancel and return to Top Level.

